  "historyNote": "#9856-A, eff 1-26-11, EXPIRED: 1-26-19 New. #12721, INTERIM, eff 1-29-19, EXPIRED: 7-29-19 New. #12860, eff 8-28-19; ss by #13246, eff 8-4-21",
